 User Session
────────────────────────────────────────────
User: {NATVC_USERNAME}
Identity: {NATVC_WHOIS}
System: {SYS_NAME} {SYS_VERSION}

 Session & Explorer
────────────────────────────────────────────
reload       · Refresh Explorer view
logoff       · End current user session
shutdown     · Power off the device
restart      · Reboot the system
hiber        · Hibernate system
software     · Launch Software Manager

 System & Recovery
────────────────────────────────────────────
.rs      · Restart to Safe Mode
.re      · Restart to Recovery Mode
.bm      · Restart to Boot Menu
.adv     · Restart to Advanced Options
.shell   · Launch Root Shell
linkmgr  · Manage Explorer Links

 Utilities & Tools
────────────────────────────────────────────
aboutsys     · Display system information
update       · Check for system updates
confedit     · Edit system configuration
usersetting  · Modify user preferences
sysfix       · Run system repair tool
filemgr      · Open File Manager
filepack     · Access file archive tool

 Tip: Use the linkmgr utility to manage application shortcuts and launcher links
